        {
          "text": "Wadaaddadii Iyo Reer Laawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba kuwanu waa wadaaddadii iyo kuwii reer Laawi oo soo raacay Serubaabel oo ahaa ina Salaatii'eel, iyo Yeeshuuca: Seraayaah, iyo Yeremyaah, iyo Cesraa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Amaryaah, iyo Malluug, iyo Xatuush, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Shekaanyaah, iyo Rexuum, iyo Mereemood, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Iddo, iyo Ginnetoy, iyo Abiiyaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Miyaamin, iyo Macadyaah, iyo Bilgaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Shemacyaah, iyo Yooyaariib, iyo Yedacyaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Sallu, iyo Caamooq, iyo Xilqiyaah, iyo Yedacyaah. Intaasu waxay ahaayeen madaxdii wadaaddada iyo walaalahoodii joogay wakhtigii Yeeshuuca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba kuwii reer Laawi waxay ahaayeen Yeeshuuca, iyo Binnuwii, iyo Qadmii'eel, iyo Sheereebyaah, iyo Yahuudah, iyo Matanyaah oo madax u ahaa mahadnaqidda, isaga iyo walaalihiisba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Baqbuqyaah iyo Cunnii oo ahaa walaalahood waxay ku jireen gudaha oo iyagay ka soo hor jeedeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yeeshuuca wuxuu dhalay Yooyaaqiim, Yooyaaqiimna wuxuu dhalay Eliyaashiib, Eliyaashiibna wuxuu dhalay Yooyaadaac, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yooyaadaacna wuxuu dhalay Yoonaataan, Yoonaataanna wuxuu dhalay Yadduuca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigii Yooyaaqiim waxaa jiray wadaaddo qabiilooyin madax u ahaa; waxaa reer Seraayaah u ahaa Meraayaah, reer Yeremyaahna Xananyaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "reer Cesraana Meshullaam, reer Amaryaahna Yehooxaanaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "reer Meliikuuna Yoonaataan, reer Shebanyaahna Yuusuf, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "reer Haarimna Cadnaa, reer Meraayoodna Xelqay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "reer Iddona Sekaryaah, reer Ginnetoonna Meshullaam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "reer Abiiyaahna Sikrii, reer Minyaamiinna, reer Moocadyaahna Filtay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "reer Bilgaahna Shammuuca, reer Shemacyaahna Yehoonaataan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "reer Yooyaariibna Matenay, reer Yedacyaahna Cusii, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "reer Sallayna Qallay, reer Caamooqna Ceeber, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "reer Xilqiyaahna Xashabyaah, reer Yedacyaahna Netaneel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwii reer Laawi oo joogay wakhtigii Eliyaashiib, iyo Yooyaadaac, iyo Yooxaanaan iyo Yadduuca waxay ahaayeen madaxda qabiilooyinka oo la qoray; waxaa kaloo la qoray wadaaddadii joogay ilaa boqornimadii Daariyus kii reer Faaris ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwii reer Laawi oo ahaa madaxdii qabiilooyinka waxaa lagu qoray kitaabkii taariikhda tan iyo wakhtigii Yooxaanaan oo ahaa ina Eliyaashiib. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwii reer Laawi madaxda u ahaa waxay ahaayeen Xashabyaah, iyo Sheereebyaah, iyo Yeeshuuca oo ahaa ina Qadmii'eel, iyo walaalahoodii iyaga ka soo hor jeeday inay Ilaah ammaanaan oo ay u mahad naqaan, siduu amray Daa'uud oo ahaa ninkii Ilaah, iyagoo iska soo hor jeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Matanyaah, iyo Baqbuqyaah, iyo Cobadyaah, iyo Meshullaam, iyo Talmon, iyo Caquub waxay ahaayeen irid-dhawryadii dhawri jiray bakhaarradii u dhowaa irdaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwaasu waxay joogeen wakhtigii Yooyaaqiim oo ahaa ina Yeeshuuca, ina Yoosaadaaq, iyo wakhtigii taliyihii Nexemyaah ahaa iyo wakhtigii wadaadkii Cesraa oo karraaniga ahaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gooni Ka Dhigiddii Derbiga Yeruusaalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii derbigii Yeruusaalem gaar laga dhigay kuwii reer Laawi mid kasta meeshiisii baa laga doondoonay in iyaga Yeruusaalem la keeno si gaarkadhigidda farxad loogu sameeyo, oo mahadnaqid iyo gabay, iyo suxuun laysku garaaco, iyo shareerado, iyo kataaradoba Ilaah loogu ammaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwii gabayaaga ahaana waxay iska soo urursadeen bannaankii Yeruusaalem ku wareegsanaa iyo tuulooyinkii reer Netofaah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo weliba Beytgilgaal, iyo beerihii Gebac, iyo Casmawed, waayo, kuwii gabayaaga ahaa tuulooyin ayay ka dhisteen Yeruusaalem hareeraheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa wadaaddadii iyo kuwii reer Laawi isdaahiriyeen, oo waxay kaloo daahiriyeen dadkii iyo irdihii iyo derbigii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaan amiirradii dalka Yahuudah keenay derbiga dushiisa, oo waxaan doortay laba kooxood oo waaweyn oo mahad naqa, oo kooxba raggeedu isdaba socdo. Midi waxay tagtay xagga midig derbiga dushiisa ee Iridda Digada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxaa iyagii daba galay Hooshacyaah iyo amiirradii dalka Yahuudah badhkood, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Casaryaah, iyo Cesraa, iyo Meshullaam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.33"
